{"id":"vod_sn_37064","vodId":"37064","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"噬魂师NOT!","name_cn":"噬魂师NOT!","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d769b31be056a8b9fc418377540a674a.jpg"},"summary":"春鸟鸫（千菅春香 配音）是一位十四岁的平凡少女，她即将进入著名的死神武器工匠专科学校开始崭新的高中生活，在入校第一天，小鸫就幸运的遇见了EAT的玛嘉（小见川千明 配音），玛嘉送给了小鸫一本书，就此彻底虏获了小鸫的芳心，小鸫甚至因为憧憬玛嘉，而像她一样扎起了双马尾。　　多多音美美（悠木碧 配音）是小鸫的室友，个性大大咧咧，呆萌又迟钝，常常连自己的名字都忘记。阿尼娅（早见沙织 配音）是小鸫的另一位室友，样貌高贵美丽的她却对庶民的一切有着狂热的兴趣，虽然个性傲娇却有着意外可爱的一面。三个女孩在学校的精彩生活就此拉开了序幕。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:48:29","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/GkWmbyTzYB1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/hVQQSfJiJ51/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/LScm8yZVFw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/CeAsqh5yR91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sG2AwsNTpx1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/4CBDgQaRS01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/2YXeB8B3dr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/QtRD551tjY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/70nCFb73GA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/7YR2nTfdQh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rNVHefw9FY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/07/Uc7Qb0KXw81/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:15.354Z"}